  "description": {
    "text": "The 2007 Gym Challenge, the store representative match of Japan's Official Pokémon Card Gyms, sent the top two of each division, not just the winner, to the Gym Final, with a silver Victory Medal that has a 2006 copyright and no stamp. The Gym Challenge tournaments held to launch the Secret of the Lakes expansion and the Rampardos and Bastiodon half decks, played with 30-card decks, gave out the eight Trade Please DP promos, Turtwig, Chimchar, Piplup, Pachirisu, Mime Jr., Staravia, Buneary and Glameow (017 to 024/DP-P), first handed out at that winter's 25th Next Generation World Hobby Fair: every player got three cards for a first match, two for a second and three for a third, win or lose."
  },
